# MCP Server Briefing — Required at Conversation Start

At the start of every new conversation, read ALL MCP server tool and resource descriptors
from the mcps folder, then present the briefing below to the user before any other work.
Do not summarize or skip tools. Do not assume you already know the tool list — re-read it.

## Briefing Format

Present a single message at conversation open structured as:

```
## MCP Tools Active This Conversation — Mode: [Agent | Plan | Debug | Ask]

### REQUIRED in this mode
[list tools that must be called for the current mode]

### AVAILABLE in this mode (discretionary)
[list tools usable at agent judgment]

### NOT USED in this mode
[list tools that do not apply to this mode — state why]

### REQUIRES EXPLICIT USER INSTRUCTION BEFORE USE (any mode)
[list tools that must never be called without the user asking]

### REFERENCE RESOURCES AVAILABLE (any mode)
[list MCP resources — documents — and what they contain]
```